Package: vscode-search-provider
Version: @VERSION@
Architecture: all
Maintainer: jannik-el <jannik.elsaesser@gmx.net>
Depends: gjs (>= 1.80), gir1.2-glib-2.0 (>= 2.80), gnome-shell (>= 46)
Section: gnome
Priority: optional
Description: GNOME Shell search provider for recent VS Code projects
 Shows recently opened VS Code folders and workspaces in the GNOME overview
 and Search Light, and opens them in VS Code. D-Bus activated; it starts on
 the first search and exits after two idle minutes.
